
# Simulated SSH server configuration for testing

Port 22
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no

KbdInteractiveAuthentication yes
ChallengeResponseAuthentication yes
UsePAM yes

MaxAuthTries 10
MaxSessions 10
LoginGraceTime 120
StrictModes yes

X11Forwarding yes
AllowAgentForwarding yes
AllowTcpForwarding yes
GatewayPorts yes
PermitTunnel yes
PermitUserRC yes

ClientAliveInterval 0
ClientAliveCountMax 3
IgnoreRhosts no
HostbasedAuthentication no

SyslogFacility AUTH
LogLevel INFO

# Additional configuration directives
PrintMotd yes
PrintLastLog yes
TCPKeepAlive yes
Compression yes
